  "notes": "# Tezbar 0.3.0-beta.11\r\n\r\n## AI chat\r\n\r\n- Use the redesigned native conversation view, with message actions aligned under user messages and no bulk delete button in history.\r\n- Return to the conversation list while a reply continues in the background. The list shows when an agent is starting, thinking, using tools, generating, or waiting for approval.\r\n- Keep tool calls, thinking, and response text in arrival order. Fix a crash when scrolling a populated transcript.\r\n\r\n## Startup and idle work\r\n\r\n- Register the production shortcut during startup and open the launcher with a left-click on the macOS menu-bar icon.\r\n- Validate the signed macOS app's startup requirements before packaging.\r\n- Filter ignored paths earlier, skip unchanged indexing work, and avoid idle polling in the file watcher, clipboard, and chat.\r\n",
